,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"If a 'Test Continuity Plan' occurs with Test Outcome is Pass, then a 'Review Test Results' must occur after that 'Test Continuity Plan' and before any subsequent 'Test Continuity Plan' occurs; no other occurrence of 'Test Continuity Plan' is allowed between a 'Test Continuity Plan' and its corresponding 'Review Test Results'. This constraint applies up to 2 times.\",\"template\":\"Alternate Response\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Test Continuity Plan\",\"description\":\"The 'Test Continuity Plan' activity executes tests on the continuity plan, resulting in a Test Outcome of Pass or Fail.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Review Test Results\",\"description\":\"The 'Review Test Results' activity analyzes test outcomes, evaluating Plan Effectiveness as a percentage between 0.0 and 100.0.\"},\"activation_condition\":\"A.Test Outcome is Pass\",\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":2},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"If a 'Review Test Results' occurs with Plan Effectiveness < 80.0, then 'Implement Improvements' must occur after it within 0 to 48 hours, and the Improvement Status must be Pending.\",\"template\":\"Response\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Review Test Results\",\"description\":\"The 'Review Test Results' activity analyzes test outcomes, evaluating Plan Effectiveness as a percentage between 0.0 and 100.0.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Implement Improvements\",\"description\":\"The 'Implement Improvements' activity addresses identified weaknesses, with an Improvement Status of Completed or Pending.\"},\"activation_condition\":\"A.Plan Effectiveness < 80.0\",\"correlation_condition\":\"T.Improvement Status is Pending\",\"time_condition\":\"0,48,h\",\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"If a 'Develop Continuity Plan' occurs with Stakeholder Engagement is High, then a 'Communicate Plan' must occur after it between 5 and 13 minutes and the Communication Method must be in (Email, Meeting).\",\"template\":\"Response\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Develop Continuity Plan\",\"description\":\"The 'Develop Continuity Plan' activity involves creating the business continuity plan, considering Stakeholder Engagement levels of High, Moderate, or Low.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Communicate Plan\",\"description\":\"The 'Communicate Plan' activity distributes the plan to stakeholders using a Communication Method of Email, Meeting, or Newsletter.\"},\"activation_condition\":\"A.Stakeholder Engagement is High\",\"correlation_condition\":\"T.Communication Method in (Email, Meeting)\",\"time_condition\":\"5,13,m\",\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"If a 'Communicate Plan' occurs with Communication Method is Meeting, then 'Conduct Training' must also occur at least once within the same process instance, either before or after the 'Communicate Plan'.\",\"template\":\"Responded Existence\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Communicate Plan\",\"description\":\"The 'Communicate Plan' activity distributes the plan to stakeholders using a Communication Method of Email, Meeting, or Newsletter.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Conduct Training\",\"description\":\"The 'Conduct Training' activity trains staff on the continuity plan, involving Training Hours between 1 and 40.\"},\"activation_condition\":\"A.Communication Method is Meeting\",\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"The 'Activate Continuity Plan' is permitted to occur only if an 'Identify Risks' activity has occurred before it within the same process instance, and only when Incident Severity is in (Medium, High).\",\"template\":\"Precedence\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Activate Continuity Plan\",\"description\":\"The 'Activate Continuity Plan' activity is triggered during actual incidents based on Incident Severity of Low, Medium, or High.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Identify Risks\",\"description\":\"T